// Helpdesk — the design tokens.
//
// ⚑ THE DIRECTION IS THE FLOOR'S. "Switchboard" was designed for this
//   desk and then raised into `Osysharp.Ui` itself (Mona Sans + Martian Mono, the neutral green-cyan surfaces, ONE line
//   cyan accent meaning "live, and yours", amber for time running out, red for breached, slate-violet for waiting on
//   somebody else). So the desk re-themes nothing the kit already says; it adds only what is its own — the widths of
//   its three panes. Its reports follow the theme with no line here: the chart kit's first series IS the accent.
theme Helpdesk {
  Length {
    /// The views column on a wide screen.
    ViewsW = "232px";
    /// The ticket list beside the open ticket.
    ListW = "440px";
    /// The customer panel on the ticket's right.
    ContextW = "300px";
  }
}
